{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And the angel came to Abimelech in a dream</b> — on account of Abraham's honor. Here it is written 'taking,' and so with Pharaoh; only upon Pharaoh He brought great plagues, and upon his house, but the plagues of Abimelech and his house were not so, for he was more righteous than Pharaoh."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:14.586108829Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}